== instances (filtered, paged) ==
items i-1:running i-2:running i-3:running
tokens -,p2
filters DescribeInstances Filter.1.Name=instance-state-name;Filter.1.Value.1=running
== chained filters ==
filters DescribeInstances Filter.1.Name=instance-state-name;Filter.1.Value.1=running;Filter.2.Name=instance-type;Filter.2.Value.1=t3.micro;Filter.2.Value.2=t3.small
== security groups ==
items sg-1:web sg-2:db
== volumes ==
items vol-1:available
== lazy typed stream ==
stream i-1 i-2 i-3
== actions ==
StartInstances i-1
StopInstances i-2
TerminateInstances i-3
